Git aur GitHub ka role yahan samjho:

Git → changes/version manage karta hai
GitHub → code online store karta hai
Vercel → website ko deploy/live karta hai

Important terms
Git = project ke versions/changes manage karne ka tool
GitHub = Git repositories ko online host karne ka platform
Repository (Repo) = aapke project ka online/managed folder
Commit = kisi change ko Git mein save karna
Push = local Git se changes GitHub par bhejna
Pull = GitHub se latest changes lena
Clone = GitHub project ki copy laptop par lana
Aapke website workflow mein

Aapne jo GitHub → Vercel workflow use kiya tha, usmein roughly:

HTML/CSS/JS → Git → GitHub Repository → Vercel → Live Website
